color-coded PlantUML sequence diagram with 🟢 success, 🔴 failure, and 🟠 optional/background actions and can also add background colored lifelines 
@startuml
' === Theme settings ===
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E0F7FA
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    ActorBorderColor Black
    ArrowThickness 1
    ArrowFontSize 12
}

' === Actors/Participants with custom colors ===
actor User #FFF9C4
participant "Web/Mobile" as Client #E3F2FD
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW #FFECB3
participant "Auth Service\n(Keycloak/OIDC)" as Auth #C8E6C9
participant "User Service" as UserSvc #FFE0B2
database "User DB" as UserDB #F8BBD0
participant "Cache (Redis)" as Cache #D1C4E9

' === Flow ===
== Login Flow ==
User -> Client: enter credentials
Client -[#green]-> APIGW: POST /auth/login {creds} 🟢
APIGW -[#green]-> Auth: validate credentials (or redirect) 🟢
Auth -[#green]-> UserDB: lookup user by email (or use LDAP) 🟢
UserDB -[#green]-> Auth: user record 🟢
Auth -[#orange]-> Cache: store session/jti (optional) 🟠
Auth -[#green]-> APIGW: JWT + refresh token 🟢
APIGW -[#green]-> Client: 200 {JWT} 🟢

== Profile Fetch ==
Client -[#green]-> APIGW: GET /profile (Authorization: Bearer JWT) 🟢
APIGW -[#green]-> UserSvc: validate token (or introspect) 🟢
UserSvc -[#orange]-> Cache: check profile (optional) 🟠
alt Cache Hit 🟢
    Cache -[#green]-> UserSvc: profile 🟢
else Cache Miss 🔴
    UserSvc -[#green]-> UserDB: read profile 🟢
    UserDB -[#green]-> UserSvc: profile 🟢
end
UserSvc -[#green]-> APIGW: profile 🟢
APIGW -[#green]-> Client: profile response 🟢

@enduml
